<meta charset='utf-8'><section data-mw-section-id="6" id="mwfQ" aria-labelledby="아미가OS" style="color: rgb(47, 51, 53); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(220, 218, 215); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3" style="color: rgb(38, 41, 43); font-weight: bold; margin: 0.25em 0px; padding-top: 0.5em; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flow-root; word-break: break-word; font-size: 1.2em; line-height: 1.6;"><h3 id="아미가OS" style="color: inherit; font-weight: bold; margin: 0px 0px 0.25em; padding: 0px; display: inline; word-break: break-word; font-size: inherit; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.6; font-family: sans-serif !important; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; scroll-margin-top: 75px;">아미가OS</h3><span class="mw-editsection" style="user-select: none; font-size: small; font-weight: normal; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 0px; margin-inline: 1em 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 0; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-family: sans-serif;"></span></div><p id="mwfg" style="margin: 0.5em 0px 1em;"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%95%84%EB%AF%B8%EA%B0%80" title="아미가" id="mwfw" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">아미가</a> 운영체제는 256개의 단위를 사용하여, 동시에 여러 클립보드를 가질 수 있다.<sup about="#mwt36" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-16" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-16&quot;}}" style="line-height: 1; unicode-bidi: isolate; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 13.6px;"><a href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%81%B4%EB%A6%BD%EB%B3%B4%EB%93%9C#cite_note-16" id="mwgA" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwgQ" style="pointer-events: none;"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwgg" style="pointer-events: none;">[</span>16<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwgw" style="pointer-events: none;">]</span></span></a></sup></p></section><section data-mw-section-id="7" id="mwhA" aria-labelledby="안드로이드" style="color: rgb(47, 51, 53); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(220, 218, 215); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3" style="color: rgb(38, 41, 43); font-weight: bold; margin: 0.25em 0px; padding-top: 0.5em; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flow-root; word-break: break-word; font-size: 1.2em; line-height: 1.6;"><h3 id="안드로이드" style="color: inherit; font-weight: bold; margin: 0px 0px 0.25em; padding: 0px; display: inline; word-break: break-word; font-size: inherit; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.6; font-family: sans-serif !important; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; scroll-margin-top: 75px;"><span id=".EC.95.88.EB.93.9C.EB.A1.9C.EC.9D.B4.EB.93.9C" typeof="mw:FallbackId"></span>안드로이드</h3><span class="mw-editsection" style="user-select: none; font-size: small; font-weight: normal; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 0px; margin-inline: 1em 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 0; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-family: sans-serif;"></span></div><p id="mwhQ" style="margin: 0.5em 0px 1em;">안드로이드는 하나의 클립 객체를 유지할 수 있고 시스템 전반에서 접근 가능한 클립보드를 제공한다. 단순 텍스트는 클립보드에 직접 저장되며, 복합 데이터는 참조 방식으로 저장된다. 클립 객체는 텍스트 문자열, URI 객체, 인텐트 중 하나의 형식을 갖는다.<sup about="#mwt38" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-17" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-17&quot;}}" style="line-height: 1; unicode-bidi: isolate; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 13.6px;"><a href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%81%B4%EB%A6%BD%EB%B3%B4%EB%93%9C#cite_note-17" id="mwhg" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwhw" style="pointer-events: none;"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwiA" style="pointer-events: none;">[</span>17<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwiQ" style="pointer-events: none;">]</span></span></a></sup></p><p id="mwig" style="margin: 0.5em 0px 1em;">클립보드와 상호작용하기 위해 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%AA%A8%EB%B0%94%EC%9D%BC_%EC%95%B1" title="모바일 앱" id="mwiw" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">모바일 앱</a>은 ClipboardManager 클래스<sup about="#mwt40" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-18" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-18&quot;}}" style="line-height: 1; unicode-bidi: isolate; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 13.6px;"><a href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%81%B4%EB%A6%BD%EB%B3%B4%EB%93%9C#cite_note-18" id="mwjA" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwjQ" style="pointer-events: none;"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwjg" style="pointer-events: none;">[</span>18<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwjw" style="pointer-events: none;">]</span></span></a></sup>와 시스템 호출을 사용하여 객체를 잘라내고, 복사하고, 붙여넣는다.</p><p id="mwkA" style="margin: 0.5em 0px 1em;">안드로이드 8.0에서 클립보드가 사용자 인터페이스에 처음 등장했다. 사용자가 클립보드에서 붙여넣기를 준비할 때 "클립보드" 옵션이 나타나 과거에 복사되거나 잘라낸 여러 객체에 접근할 수 있게 해준다. 그 외의 경우나 이전 버전에서는 클립보드를 사용할 수 있게 해주는 앱을 제외하고는 사용자가 클립보드에 접근할 수 없다.</p></section><section data-mw-section-id="8" id="mwkQ" aria-labelledby="iOS" style="color: rgb(47, 51, 53); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(220, 218, 215); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3" style="color: rgb(38, 41, 43); font-weight: bold; margin: 0.25em 0px; padding-top: 0.5em; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flow-root; word-break: break-word; font-size: 1.2em; line-height: 1.6;"><h3 id="iOS" style="color: inherit; font-weight: bold; margin: 0px 0px 0.25em; padding: 0px; display: inline; word-break: break-word; font-size: inherit; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.6; font-family: sans-serif !important; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; scroll-margin-top: 75px;">iOS</h3><span class="mw-editsection" style="user-select: none; font-size: small; font-weight: normal; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 0px; margin-inline: 1em 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 0; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-family: sans-serif;"></span></div><p id="mwkg" style="margin: 0.5em 0px 1em;">iOS에서의 클립보드는 OS X와 유사하게 "페이스트보드(pasteboard)"라고 불린다. 이 운영체제의 앱은 UIPasteboard 클래스의 인스턴스인 추가 페이스트보드를 생성할 수 있으며, 이는 공개되거나 비공개될 수 있다. 하나의 인스턴스는 단일 항목이나 다른 형식의 여러 항목을 보유할 수 있다.<sup about="#mwt42" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-19" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-19&quot;}}" style="line-height: 1; unicode-bidi: isolate; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 13.6px;"><a href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%81%B4%EB%A6%BD%EB%B3%B4%EB%93%9C#cite_note-19" id="mwkw" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwlA" style="pointer-events: none;"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwlQ" style="pointer-events: none;">[</span>19<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwlg" style="pointer-events: none;">]</span></span></a></sup></p><p id="mwlw" style="margin: 0.5em 0px 1em;">형식은 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/UTI_(%EC%8B%9D%EB%B3%84%EC%9E%90)" title="UTI (식별자)" id="mwmA" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">UTI</a>에 의해 식별된다.<sup about="#mwt44" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-20" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-20&quot;}}" style="line-height: 1; unicode-bidi: isolate; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 13.6px;"><a href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%81%B4%EB%A6%BD%EB%B3%B4%EB%93%9C#cite_note-20" id="mwmQ" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwmg" style="pointer-events: none;"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwmw" style="pointer-events: none;">[</span>20<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwnA" style="pointer-events: none;">]</span></span></a></sup></p><p id="mwnQ" style="margin: 0.5em 0px 1em;">페이스트보드에 포함된 데이터는 GUI를 통해서는 접근할 수 없으며, 시스템과 응용 프로그램을 통해서만 접근할 수 있다.</p></section><section data-mw-section-id="9" id="mwng" aria-labelledby="MacOS" style="color: rgb(47, 51, 53); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(220, 218, 215); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3" style="color: rgb(38, 41, 43); font-weight: bold; margin: 0.25em 0px; padding-top: 0.5em; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flow-root; word-break: break-word; font-size: 1.2em; line-height: 1.6;"><h3 id="MacOS" style="color: inherit; font-weight: bold; margin: 0px 0px 0.25em; padding: 0px; display: inline; word-break: break-word; font-size: inherit; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.6; font-family: sans-serif !important; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; scroll-margin-top: 75px;">MacOS</h3><span class="mw-editsection" style="user-select: none; font-size: small; font-weight: normal; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 0px; margin-inline: 1em 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 0; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-family: sans-serif;"></span></div><p id="mwnw" style="margin: 0.5em 0px 1em;"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/MacOS" title="MacOS" id="mwoA" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">macOS</a>의 클립보드는 사용 가능한 여러 형식의 항목 하나를 보유한다.</p><p id="mwoQ" style="margin: 0.5em 0px 1em;">클립보드의 내용은 Finder의 편집 메뉴에서 클립보드 보기 메뉴 항목을 선택하여 볼 수 있다. 원시 데이터와 저장된 형식은 ClipboardViewer를 사용하여 확인할 수 있다.<sup about="#mwt46" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-21" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-21&quot;}}" style="line-height: 1; unicode-bidi: isolate; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 13.6px;"><a href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%81%B4%EB%A6%BD%EB%B3%B4%EB%93%9C#cite_note-21" id="mwog" title="" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwow" style="pointer-events: none;"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwpA" style="pointer-events: none;">[</span>21<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwpQ" style="pointer-events: none;">]</span></span></a></sup></p></section>